Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.24,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This strange story began\Non a blistering hot day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had received an unexpected mail{\i0}\N{\i1}from an old acquaintance of mine,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the message was just this:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Seek the sacred beast from Anzan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am at the meeting place of the four gods."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pao, the sender of the message,{\i0}\N{\i1}was an acquaintance of mine,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it didn't mean that we{\i0}\N{\i1}kept in touch all that well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I grew suspicious, and started to\Nresearch Pao's current whereabouts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They say that Pao is one of the three{\i0}\N{\i1}greatest Feng Shui masters here on Mars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But when I found his whereabouts,{\i0}\N{\i1}he had already left this world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you weren't the\None that sent me this mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who visits from\Nthe inauspicious back door...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Receive the word from the heavens,\Nand lead me to the sun stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like what the\Npa-kua told me! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you shooting?! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are disrespectful fellows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape route! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi of Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was really close! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there... Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's a new girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, she's rather young.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird one, hot dog bun, loved one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's his secret love-child?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, she's rather old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Child, mild, wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting Pao's daughter\Nto be this old already...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably don't remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I met you once when\Nyou were this little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just an acquaintance.\NIt's been 10 years already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But your father sure was unlucky\Nto be in a traffic accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On the way to Jupiter, there was a sudden\Nspatial fluctuation in hyperspace...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the "girlfriend?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the "secret love-child?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jet, why were you at the graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody outside the family knows\Nhe got into an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"Seek the sacred beast from Anzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at the meeting place of the four gods."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao sent me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before the accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Can you help me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is the whereabouts\Nof the sun stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The direction, day, and time you arrived\Nwas the best combination for Feng Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when you're\Nsearching for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. About that, we will have it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How was the boss feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it could be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't have any particular favors{\i0}\N{\i1}to repay to Pao or this girl,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I decided to help them for now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There were too many things that made{\i0}\N{\i1}me suspicious to leave it alone.{\i0} {link to next line?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did Pao send me mail{\i0}\N{\i1}right before his death?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do those words mean?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who were those guys that attacked us?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And there was something about{\i0}\N{\i1}this girl named Meifa as well...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This universe is made of three different Chis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One is the Chi of Heaven,\Nthe energy that comes from the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One is the Chi of Earth, the energy\Nthat comes from a planet's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly Chi of Magnetism, the Chi\Nthat organisms like ourselves produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi from organisms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The human body always\Nproduces a magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That magnetic field and\Nthe magnetic field of the Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,react to one another to create energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Universal Feng Shui is the\Ntechnology that reads the energies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,of nature such as this to\Nuse them in everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Universal Feng Shui...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the same thing\Nas fortunetelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Other fortunetelling methods\Nonly predict or prognosticate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Universal Feng Shui has the\Npower to make the bad into the good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, if you were a Feng Shui\Nmaster as powerful as my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized that I never spent\Ntime like this with my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me point out that I'm not that old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, I would be a boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, that would be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I can be an elder\Nbrother or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,ICE cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mr. Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that "Anzan" refers to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mountain Hotel Building...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Seiryu! (Blue Dragon)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Byakko! (White Tiger)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Genbu! (Black Turtle)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzaku! (Scarlet Phoenix)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, the cross-zenith method!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun stone is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.\NThey're right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the sun stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Outta the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One bottle of lao-chu. I don't need a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, you think we would\Ntell you that easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We're from the Blue Snake...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are{\i0} from a syndicate...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you following us around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't tell you that\Neven if you killed me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It was because we couldn't get Pao...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So they told us to get\Nthe recipient of his mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the low end so we\Ndon't know any more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My father... is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pao's words showed where this stone was.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does that mean Pao is still alive somewhere?{\i0} {13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he want me to find this stone\Nand do something with it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like I created more{\i0}\N{\i1}mysteries instead of solving them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For now, I decided to check out{\i0}\N{\i1}this stone, which was our only clue.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is a piece of the moon from\Nthat Gate accident 50 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We Feng Shui masters call it the sun stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's absorbed the fluctuations\Nin time and space
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and conceals a tremendous\Namount of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only think of it as a plain old rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how much would it be if we sold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're gonna smoke, go smoke outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You always smoke in here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm turning this into a\Nnonsmoking area starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, you're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is {\i1}my{\i0} ship, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you gonna do with this stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I... have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what my father is thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ein! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The luopan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be... I took the magnet off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... I get it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly,\Nmy father owned a sun stone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that the two stones are resonating
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,to show me the whereabouts of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why Pao made you\Nlook for this stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why my father\Nsent the mail to you, Mr. Jet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They make a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dangerous combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The more righteous a guy was in his youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the more likely he's gonna fall\Nfor a young girl later in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really... Guys are so clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My father
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.13,0:15:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,was one that believed in Universal\NFeng Shui, but not other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So my mother left the house,\Nand took me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was seven years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure my father was able\Nto find our whereabouts easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But he never even tried to look for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there was a reason behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was my father targeted by those men?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it because he was\Nfriends with bad people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who my father really was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,was the consultant for a syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao had leaked information to me about the syndicate, back when I was a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao already wanted out of\Nthe syndicate back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's impossible\Nfor someone who knows
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,important syndicate secrets\Nto ever leave the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Pao was afraid that more\Nbad things would happen to his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you can confirm\Nit all when you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything here. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the radar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be... I'm sure this is the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, Faye, please take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they {\i1}your{\i0} guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out if you don't\Nwanna die with this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What rotten luck of the draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sometimes it's good to act selflessly.{\i0} {Original: "Sometimes it's good to act without asking "What's in it for me?"."}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fairies who are going to\Ngrant the princess' wish. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unmanned fighters? {8 frames if you start on that faintest mmm sound}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So these would be the seven dwarves...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! They're trying to scare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike! Come back here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, if we apply\Nlots of energy to that stone,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we can draw out all the{\i0}\N{\i1}forces trapped inside it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an all-or-nothing plan, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it is, just hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:18:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I put it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blast this rock with your plasma cannon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great plan this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.03,0:20:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like you made it in time, Jet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao! You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meifa... It's been a while.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pao, you're in unstable territory.\NI can't approach any closer than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know... There isn't any{\i0}\N{\i1}oxygen left in here anyway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I sent you that mail because I wanted{\i0}\N{\i1}you to bring my daughter here...{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... you willed us to be here\Nlike this using Feng Shui?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:20:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true, Pao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Meifa is here now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,because she {\i1}wanted{\i0} to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You might be right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps I was being too hotheaded...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meifa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's wonderful to see you one last time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated you all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I despised you all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, I don't know if it was a good thing{\i0}\N{\i1}or a bad thing that we took her along.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In any case, this was how{\i0}\N{\i1}this strange case ended.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She went back to Mars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the smoking ban was lifted{\i0}\N{\i1}from the living quarters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once again, unchanging daily life{\i0}\N{\i1}has returned, just as it was before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One thing that has changed, though...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I no longer read the fortunetelling\Npages in magazines.{\i0}
