Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:54.23,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.48,0:23:54.23,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.85,0:24:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He... came with a whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A man, Andy, made a sudden\Nappearance on horseback.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world is he? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he an ally or a foe?\NOr is he a true cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The next episode is a shocking sci-fi\Nmacaroni-western epic saga: Cowboy Funk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, isn't this\Nworld view a bit different?
